# Assignment Scope and Deliverables

## Core product (Docsync)

- Create, rename, edit, auto-save, reopen documents
- Rich text: bold, italic, underline, headings, lists
- Import `.md` / `.txt` (≤ 5 MB)
- Ownership + sharing between users; persist in Supabase
- Authorization via RLS; at least one meaningful automated test suite

## Required submission files

`README.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `AI_WORKFLOW.md`, `SUBMISSION.md`, `LIVE_URL.txt`, `WALKTHROUGH_URL.txt`, plus walkthrough video when ready.

## Workflow preferences

- Inspect existing code before proposing changes
- Plan substantial work before implementing
- Keep changes scoped; no unrelated features for polish alone
- Do not commit, push, or deploy unless explicitly asked
- Do not invent features, test results, or verification claims
- Distinguish **Complete / Partial / Missing / Failed / Not Verified** when auditing

Use `assignment-completion-audit` for status audits; use `fsd-feature-implementation` for feature work.
